{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP NAMES HEATHER DEICHLER AS NEW SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF MONEYGUARD PRODUCT MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP ANNOUNCED THAT HEATHER DEICHLER HAS JOINED THE COMPANY IN THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND HEAD OF LINCOLN MONEYGUARD® PRODUCT MANAGEMENT. IN THIS ROLE, DEICHLER WILL OVERSEE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT, PRICING AND MANAGEMENT, FOR LINCOLN’S MONEYGUARD SOLUTION. DEICHLER IS BASED IN GREENSBORO, NC AND REPORTS TO MIKE BURNS, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND HEAD OF LIFE SOLUTIONS. DEICHLER JOINS LINCOLN FROM NEW YORK LIFE WHERE SHE MOST RECENTLY HELD THE POSITION OF HEAD OF LONG-TERM CARE AND LINKED BENEFITS PRODUCTS, MARKETING, COMMUNICATION AND STRATEGY. HEATHER HAS ALSO HELD LEADERSHIP ROLES IN THE COMPANY’S GROUP AND WORKSITE BUSINESS, ITS GROUP MEMBERSHIP ASSOCIATION DEPARTMENT, AND ADVANCED MARKETS NETWORK.'}{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP NAMES HEATHER DEICHLER AS NEW SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF MONEYGUARD PRODUCT MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP ANNOUNCED THAT HEATHER DEICHLER HAS JOINED THE COMPANY IN THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND HEAD OF LINCOLN MONEYGUARD® PRODUCT MANAGEMENT. IN THIS ROLE, DEICHLER WILL OVERSEE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT, PRICING AND MANAGEMENT, FOR LINCOLN’S MONEYGUARD SOLUTION. DEICHLER IS BASED IN GREENSBORO, NC AND REPORTS TO MIKE BURNS, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND HEAD OF LIFE SOLUTIONS. DEICHLER JOINS LINCOLN FROM NEW YORK LIFE WHERE SHE MOST RECENTLY HELD THE POSITION OF HEAD OF LONG-TERM CARE AND LINKED BENEFITS PRODUCTS, MARKETING, COMMUNICATION AND STRATEGY. HEATHER HAS ALSO HELD LEADERSHIP ROLES IN THE COMPANY’S GROUP AND WORKSITE BUSINESS, ITS GROUP MEMBERSHIP ASSOCIATION DEPARTMENT, AND ADVANCED MARKETS NETWORK.'}{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP NAMES HEATHER DEICHLER AS NEW SENIOR VICE PRE